{"id":"vperedi","lemma":"впереди","pos":"adv","rank":898,"glosses":["in front (of), ahead (of), before"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/26/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я хотел сидеть впереди.","en":"I wanted to sit in the front.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to sit"},null]},{"text":"Что это за большое здание впереди?","en":"What is that big building in front of us?","words":[null,null,{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},{"g":"building"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why"]]},{"text":"Мы опять впереди.","en":"We're ahead again.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"again"},null]},{"text":"Те трое были впереди нас.","en":"Those three were ahead of us.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"three , three of them"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"}]},{"text":"Том хочет сидеть впереди.","en":"Tom wants to sit in the front.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to sit"},null]}]}